      "text": "[6:55AM]  #Marina\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nThere is good movement from UBA roundabout towards NNPC filling station.\n Inward  Cathedral church down to Nitel intersection is good to go as well.\n\nTraffic from State House inward MCwen bridge and force road is looking good.\n\nWhile movement from Onikan roundabout towards TBS,  Water board connecting Nitel intersection is good.\n\nThe entire stretch of Broad Street is perfectly ok.\n\n Igbosere road and Catholic mission Street connecting Ganiu Smith Street is very much in perfect shape.\n\ngood movement from Zone 2 underneath the bridge towards Flag staff House connecting MCwen bridge.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
